  "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
  "label": "The joyful, confident man symbolizes living your life fully",
  "description": "The text 'live your life every moment' is mapped onto the visual of the older man in a formal suit. His joyful expression and confident posture are used as a visual metaphor for the concept of living fully and embracing each moment. The image leverages the cultural association of a dignified, happy older man with wisdom and fulfillment to reinforce the inspirational message. This is an analogical mapping where the visual entity (the man) represents the abstract concept (living every moment) conveyed by the text.",
